escription":"Keyed by role name. A subset of OGC API - Processes Part 1 Core's own InputDescription: `title`/`description` carry the \"signature\" informally, `minOccurs`/`maxOccurs` are the one machine-checkable property this tier actually has (Table 21: Input.Multiplicity, D).","required":true,"schema_type":"object","sources":["bblocks://generic-profiles.generic-profile"],"effectiveId":"https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/inputs"},{"path":["inputs","title"],"id":"http://purl.org/dc/terms/title","vocab":"https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/generic-profile/inputs/","required":true,"schema_type":"string","sources":["bblocks://generic-profiles.generic-profile"],"effectiveId":"http://purl.org/dc/terms/title"},{"path":["inputs","description"],"id":"http://purl.org/dc/terms/description","vocab":"https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/generic-profile/inputs/","schema_type":"string","sources":["bblocks://generic-profiles.generic-profile"],"effectiveId":"http://purl.org/dc/terms/description"},{"path":["inputs","keywords"],"id":"https://w3id.org/ogc/api/processes/keywords","vocab":"https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/generic-profile/inputs/","required":true,"schema_type":"array","sources":["bblocks://generic-profiles.generic-profile"],"effectiveId":"https://w3id.org/ogc/api/processes/keywords"},{"path":["inputs","metadata"],"id":"https://w3id.org/ogc/api/processes/metadata","vocab":"https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/generic-profile/inputs/","required":true,"schema_type":"array","sources":["bblocks://generic-profiles.generic-profile"],"ref":"0","effectiveId":"https://w3id.org/ogc/api/processes/metadata"},{"path":["inputs","minOccurs"],"id":"https://w3id.org/ogc/api/processes/minOccurs","vocab":"https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/generic-profile/inputs/","schema_type":"integer","sources":["bblocks://generic-profiles.generic-profile"],"effectiveId":"https://w3id.org/ogc/api/processes/minOccurs"},{"path":["inputs","maxOccurs"],"id":"https://w3id.org/ogc/api/processes/maxOccurs","vocab":"https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/generic-profile/inputs/","sources":["bblocks://generic-profiles.generic-profile"],"effectiveId":"https://w3id.org/ogc/api/processes/maxOccurs"},{"path":["outputs"],"id":"https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/outputs","description":"Keyed by role name. No `minOccurs`/`maxOccurs` -- Table 21 has no Output.Multiplicity row (and, per the same reasoning as the earlier `cardinality`-on-outputs mistake this replaces, an output's internal structure, e.g. a raster's band count, is not an output cardinality either way; see generic-profiles.implementation-profile.raster-band-math-multiband's `description.md`).","required":true,"schema_type":"object","sources":["bblocks://generic-profiles.generic-profile"],"effectiveId":"https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/outputs"},{"path":["outputs","title"],"id":"http://purl.org/dc/terms/title","vocab":"https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/generic-profile/outputs/","required":true,"schema_type":"string","sources":["bblocks://generic-profiles.generic-profile"],"effectiveId":"http://purl.org/dc/terms/title"},{"path":["outputs","description"],"id":"http://purl.org/dc/terms/description","vocab":"https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/generic-profile/outputs/","schema_type":"string","sources":["bblocks://generic-profiles.generic-profile"],"effectiveId":"http://purl.org/dc/terms/description"},{"path":["outputs","keywords"],"id":"https://w3id.org/ogc/api/processes/keywords","vocab":"https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/generic-profile/outputs/","required":true,"schema_type":"array","sources":["bblocks://generic-profiles.generic-profile"],"effectiveId":"https://w3id.org/ogc/api/processes/keywords"},{"path":["outputs","metadata"],"id":"https://w3id.org/ogc/api/processes/metadata","vocab":"https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/generic-profile/outputs/","description":"Table 21 Output.Metadata is D here then plain O below (no footnote a): unlike an input's, an output's metadata carries no obligation to be kept by lower tiers.","schema_type":"array","sources":["bblocks://generic-profiles.generic-profile"],"ref":"0","effectiveId":"https://w3id.org/ogc/api/processes/metadata"}]}